    "tickers": "RNMBY",
    "title": "Rheinmetall AG",
    "body": "This is just my reading between the lines with the events of the past week and what could potentially lie ahead. It's a hunch and definitely not proper DD. \n\nGermany recently pledged more support to Ukraine and the largest producer of artillery ammo in Europe is Rheinmetall $RNMBY who is positioned to provide this as well as vehicles and electronic solutions. All of which will be needed by European militaries and those of its neighbors. \n\nThis is a long term hold for me and I'll be adding as my port allows as I feel it has the potential to reach US defense contractor levels of $400+ per share and eventually surpass them all. \n\nGood luck to us if you decide to ride the tank! \ud83c\udf40",
